   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/signal.h.html\">signal.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint raise(int</tt> <i>sig</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_474_03\" id=\"tag_17_474_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]raise[/I5]() function shall send the signal [I6]sig[/I6] to the executing [S7][[A8]CX[/A8]][/S7] [IMG9] &nbsp;thread or\nprocess. [IMG10] If a signal handler is called, the [I11]raise[/I11]() function\nshall not return until after the signal handler does.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S7": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A8": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG9": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "IMG10": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "[S12][[A13]CX[/A13]][/S12] [IMG14] The\neffect of the [I15]raise[/I15]() function shall be equivalent to calling:",
    "placeholders": {
     "S12": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A13": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG14": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
